<title>UK: National Bank of Canada sets 250 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>National Bank of Canada sets 250 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Salomon AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL BANK OF CANADA</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    07.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/16	PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.966    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.966</p>
</text>
